{
  "bodyHash": "faf7b957f93d432e",
  "content": "你好世界![圖標標題](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/doc/headers/icon_header.gif)\n\n![標籤標題](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/doc/headers/tags_header.png)\n\n![客戶端標題](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/doc/headers/client_header.png)\n\n![可打開的附魔書]()\n\n使用附魔書會顯示有關該附魔的信息。其中包括詳細描述、互斥附魔列表、比較器信號以及支持的物品列表。\n\n![用附魔書右鍵點擊時的預覽]()\n\n除了附魔信息外，書面屏幕還包括顯示生成粒子要求和克隆附魔書要求的面板。**僅當服務器上也安裝了此模組時，才會顯示這些面板**\n\n![信息面板預覽]()\n\n<details>\n<summary>意圖/理由</summary>\n\n- 在不退出遊戲的情況下查看附魔細節。\n- 與此類其他模組相比，書面菜單更加身临其境，它簡單地通過工具提示顯示附魔細節。\n\n</details>\n\n![服務器標題]()\n\n![可以在講臺上放置的附魔書]()\n\n附魔書可以放置在講臺上。打開講臺將顯示與打開書相同的界面。\n\n![在講臺上放置附魔書的預覽]()\n\n<details>\n<summary>意圖/理由</summary>\n\n- 與書寫書的對齊功能\n- 允許講臺上的附魔書相關的其他功能\n\n</details>\n\n<hr></hr>\n\n![比較器信號]()\n\n附魔被分成不同的組，每組會發出不同的比較器信號強度。信號強度也在書的屏幕上顯示。\n\n![比較器信號預覽]()\n\n<details>\n<summary>所有比較器信號強度列表</summary>\n\n| 強度 | 描述             | 附魔                                                                                                                                                                        |\n| ---- | ---------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 1    | 封面             |                                                                                                                                                                                     |\n| 2    | 通用             | <ul><li> 修復 </li><li> 不毀壞 </li></ul>                                                                                                                                        |\n| 3    | 詛咒             | <ul><li> 綁縛詛咒 </li><li> 消逝詛咒</li></ul>                                                                                                                                  |\n| 4    | 通用盔甲         | <ul><li> 保護 </li><li> 爆炸保護 </li><li> 火焰保護 </li><li> 彈道保護 </li></ul>                                                                               |\n| 5    | 頭盔             | <ul><li> 水下視力 </li><li> 呼吸</li></ul>                                                                                                                                       |\n| 6    | 胸甲             | <ul><li> 荊棘 <ul><li> 非胸甲獨有 </li><li> 確保該類別有一項 </li></ul> </li></ul>                                                                           |\n| 7    | 腿部護甲         | <ul><li> 快速潛行 </li></ul>                                                                                                                                                     |\n| 8    | 鞋子             | <ul><li> 深淵漫步者 </li><li> 墜落保護 </li><li> 冰霜行者 </li><li> 靈魂速度</li></ul>                                                                         |\n| 9    | 採礦工具         | <ul><li> 效率 </li><li> 幸運 </li><li> 絲綢之觸</li></ul>                                                                                                                        |\n| 10   | 近程武器傷害     | <ul><li> 鋒利 </li><li> 亡靈克星 </li><li> 節肢動物剋星 </li><li> 穿刺 </li><li> 密度 </li><li> 破襲 </li></ul>                                                         |\n| 11   | 近程武器實用     | <ul><li> 火焰附加 </li><li> 面積性附加 </li><li> 擊退 </li><li> 掠奪 </li><li> 颶風 </li><li> 突進 </li></ul>                                                                   |\n| 12   | 遠程武器傷害     | <ul><li> 力量 </li></ul>                                                                                                                                                          |\n| 13   | 遠程武器實用     | <ul><li> 勁力 </li><li> 無窮 </li><li> 火焰 </li><li> 多點射擊 </li><li> 快速裝填 </li><li> 穿透 </li><li> 引導 </li><li> 忠誠 </li><li> 激流</li></ul>                          |\n| 14   | 其他工具         | <ul><li> 釣魚發光 </li><li> 大海的幸運</li></ul>                                                                                                                                |\n| 15   | 未使用           |                                                                                                                                                                                     |\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>意圖/理由</summary>\n\n- 基於附魔對附魔書進行基本排序\n- 允許根據書的附魔編碼紅石信號強度序列\n\n</details>\n\n<hr></hr>\n\n![粒子標題]()\n\n講臺會根據當前頁面的附魔效果發粒子特效。如果封面被選中，粒子會在所附魔的效果中隨機循環變化。\n\n粒子的持續時間取決於附近雕刻書架中書的數量。如果沒有書架或書架為空，則不會發出任何粒子。\n\n![粒子需求預覽]()\n\n|                                                                                                      |                                                                                                               |\n| ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/doc/game/mending_preview.gif\" alt=\"修復粒子\"><p>修復</p></img>                | <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/doc/game/feather_falling_preview.gif\" alt=\"墜落保護粒子\"><p>墜落保護</p></img> |\n| <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/doc/game/frost_walker_preview.gif\" alt=\"冰霜行者粒子\"><p>冰霜行者</p></img> | <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/doc/game/combined_particle_preview.gif\" alt=\"所有3個附魔效果\"><p>所有3種粒子</p></img>     |\n\n<details>\n<summary>所有粒子紋理列表</summary>\n\n遺憾的是，大部分粒子紋理都可以看作是程序員藝術\n\n| 紋理                                                                                                                                                                                               | 名稱                 | 紋理                                                                                                                                                                                                          | 名稱                   | 紋理                                                                                                                                                                                              | 名稱              |\n| -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------- |\n| <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/aqua_affinity.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Aqua affinity\"></img>        | Aqua affinity        | <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/bane_of_arthropods.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Bane of arthropods\"></img>       | Bane of arthropods     | <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/blast_protection.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Blast protection\"></img> | Blast protection  |\n| <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/breach.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Breach\"></img>                      | Breach               | <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/channeling.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Channeling\"></img>                       | Channeling             | <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/binding_curse.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Curse of Binding\"></img>    | Curse of Binding  |\n| <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/vanishing_curse.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Curse of Vanishing\">鳩 | Curse of Vanishing   | <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/density.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Density\">鳩                             | Density                | <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/depth_strider.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Depth strider\">鳩       | Depth strider     |\n| <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/efficiency.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Efficiency\">鳩              | Efficiency           | <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/feather_falling.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Feather falling\">鳩             | Feather falling        | <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/fire_aspect.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Fire aspect\">鳩           | Fire aspect       |\n| <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/fire_protection.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Fire protection\">鳩    | Fire protection      | <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/flame.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Flame\">鳩                                 | Flame                  | <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/fortune.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Fortune\">鳩                   | Fortune           |\n| <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/frost_walker.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Frost walker\">鳩          | Frost walker         | <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/impaling.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Impaling\">鳩                           | Impaling               | <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/infinity.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Infinity\">鳩                 | Infinity          |\n| <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/knockback.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Knockback\">鳩                | Knockback            | <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/looting.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Looting\">鳩                             | Looting                | <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/loyalty.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Loyalty\">鳩                   | Loyalty           |\n| <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/luck_of_the_sea.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Luck of the sea\">鳩    | Luck of the sea      | <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/lunge.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Lunge\">鳩                                 | Lunge                  | <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/lure.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Lure\">鳩                         | Lure              |\n| <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/mending.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Mending\">鳩                    | Mending              | <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/multishot.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Multishot\">鳩                         | Multishot              | <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/piercing.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Piercing\">鳩                 | Piercing          |\n| <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/power.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Power\">鳩                        | Power                | <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/projectile_protection.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Projectile protection\">鳩 | Projectile protection  | <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/protection.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Protection\">鳩             | Protection        |\n| <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/punch.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Punch\">鳩                        | Punch                | <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/quick_charge.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Quick charge\">鳩                   | Quick charge           | <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/respiration.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Respiration\">鳩           | Respiration       |\n| <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/riptide.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Riptide\">鳩                    | Riptide              | <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/sharpness.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Sharpness\">鳩                         | Sharpness              | <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/silk_touch.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Silk touch\">鳩             | Silk touch        |\n| <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/smite.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Smite\">鳩                        | Smite                | <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/soul_speed.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Soul speed\">鳩                       | Soul speed             | <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/sweeping_edge.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Sweeping edge\">鳩       | Sweeping edge     |\n| <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/swift_sneak.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Swift sneak\">鳩            | Swift sneak          | <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/thorns.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Thorns\">鳩                               | Thorns                 | <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/unbreaking.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Unbreaking\">鳩             | Unbreaking        |\n| <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/interactive_enchanted_books/textures/particle/wind_burst.png\" width=\"64px\" height=\"64px\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" alt=\"Wind burst\">鳩              | Wind burst           |                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |                        |                                                                                                                                                                                                       |                   |\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>意圖/理由</summary>\n\n- 提供了一種輕鬆生成各種粒子特效的方法。\n- 其他與紅石相關的特性使得粒子紋理和持續時間動態改變成為可能。\n\n</details>\n\n<hr></hr>\n\n![漏斗整合]()\n\n禁用方法：`/gamerule interactive_enchanted_books:hopper_interacts_with_lectern false`\n\n漏斗可以在講臺上放置書寫書或附魔書。此外，它們還能移除講臺中激活的書。\n\n![漏斗交互預覽]()\n\n<details>\n<summary>意圖/理由</summary>\n\n- 與其他區塊實體行為對齊。Vanilla 中無法使用漏斗向講臺放置書籍似乎是忽視了該功能\n- 對本模組的附魔粒子效果提供了更大的控制權\n\n</details>\n\n<hr></hr>\n\n![信號切換頁面]()\n\n禁用方法：`/gamerule interactive_enchanted_books:signal_changes_lectern_page false`\n\n向講臺發送紅石信號會增加顯示的頁面號。如果到達最後一頁，講臺會循環回到第一頁。**這會禁用默認的頁面變化會產生紅石信號的行為，觀察者仍然會檢測到頁面變化**\n\n![信號切換頁面預覽]()\n\n<details>\n<summary>意圖/理由</summary>\n\n- 由於附魔書講臺會根據當前頁面發出粒子，因此使用紅石信號動態控制當前面显示的粒子效果是可行的\n- 配合雕刻書架，可以靈活地調整粒子效果\n\n</details>\n\n<hr></hr>\n\n![回聲標題]()\n\n禁用方法：`/gamerule interactive_enchanted_books:craftable_enchantment_echo false`\n\n附魔回聲（Enchantment Echo）克隆原始物品的附魔效果，而不會銷燬該物品，並像普通附魔書一樣與其他功能互動（請參照前文）。將附魔回聲與回聲碎片結合可將其轉換為附魔書。\n\n|                                                                    |                                                    |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/doc/recipes/echo_crafting.gif\" alt=\"回聲合成\"></img> | <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bristn/minecraft-interactive-enchanted-books/refs/heads/main/doc/recipes/enchanted_book.png\" alt=\"附魔書合成\"></img> |\n\n![遊戲中的回聲合成]()\n\n<details>\n<summary>意圖/理由</summary>\n\n- 附魔回聲使其他模组功能如比较器信号和粒子效果的使用更方便，無需合并多个附魔書\n- 從已附魔的物品創建附魔回聲的能力使人們更容易瞭解附魔細節。在玩模组包時很容易找到附魔極多的物品，但大多數人都不知道這些附魔是什麼。附魔回聲提供了一個簡單的方式來在遊戲內預覽這些細節\n- 轉為真正的附魔書旨在減少對村民的需求，不過分強大，因為回聲碎片是一種有限的終期資源。\n\n</details>\n\n<hr></hr>\n\n![整合標題]()\n\n如需了解如何整合自訂附魔的更多詳情，請參考[範例倉儲]()",
